<%#
  THE GROUPED PAGE, ONE SHAPE FOR THE MAKER'S PAGE AND THE VISITOR'S (2026-09-09, tabs; spec §6).
  A LAYOUT PARTIAL: the caller renders it with a block that takes a KEY and returns that key's
  slot markup (or nothing), so each page keeps its own way of rendering a panel while the shape
  around the panels is written once.

  THE NO-TABS BRANCH IS TODAY'S MARKUP, UNCHANGED (decision 9): one `.project-panels` grid with
  every key, Publish included, and the caller's tail (the public page's repository cards) inside
  it. Every existing project takes this branch.

  WITH TABS: the top group's grid (omitted when empty), then `div.tabs` with a bar and one pane per
  tab, then Publish in its own grid -- with the tail before it -- so both are on view whichever tab
  is open (decision 3). A PANE IS RENDERED ONLY IF SOMETHING IN IT RENDERS: the bodies are captured
  first, exactly as the public page has always omitted an empty panel, and the bar lists only the
  panes that survived. Each key is yielded ONCE.

  THE LINK'S ID IS `tablink-<slug>` AND THE PANE'S IS `tab-<slug>`, WHICH IS NOT A COSMETIC CHOICE:
  the pane of a tab NAMED "build tab" is `tab-build-tab`, so an `id` built as `tab-<slug>-tab` for
  the link would collide with it and `aria-labelledby` would point at a pane instead of its own
  label. Two prefixes cannot collide whatever anyone names a tab.

  WITHOUT JAVASCRIPT nothing is hidden: the bar's links are anchors to the panes and every pane
  shows its heading -- the page reads as sections. tabs_controller.js hides the rest (decision 8).

  Locals: groups (Maker::ProjectKind::Groups); tail (HTML or nil).
%>
<% if groups.tabs.empty? %>
  <div class="project-panels" data-controller="masonry">
    <% groups.top.each do |key| %><%= yield key %><% end %>
    <%= yield "publish" %>
    <%= tail %>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <% panes = groups.tabs.filter_map do |tab|
       bodies = tab.keys.filter_map { |key| body = yield(key); body if body.present? }
       [ tab, bodies ] if bodies.any?
     end %>
  <% if groups.top.any? %>
    <div class="project-panels" data-controller="masonry">
      <% groups.top.each do |key| %><%= yield key %><% end %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
  <% if panes.any? %>
    <div class="tabs" data-controller="tabs">
      <nav class="tab-bar" role="tablist" aria-label="Page sections">
        <% panes.each_with_index do |(tab, _bodies), i| %>
          <a class="tab-link" role="tab" id="tablink-<%= tab.slug %>" href="#tab-<%= tab.slug %>"
             aria-controls="tab-<%= tab.slug %>" aria-selected="<%= i.zero? %>" tabindex="<%= i.zero? ? 0 : -1 %>"
             data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#key"><%= tab.name %></a>
        <% end %>
      </nav>
      <% panes.each do |tab, bodies| %>
        <section class="tab-pane" id="tab-<%= tab.slug %>" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tablink-<%= tab.slug %>" data-tabs-target="pane">
          <h2 class="tab-heading"><%= tab.name %></h2>
          <div class="project-panels" data-controller="masonry"><%= safe_join(bodies) %></div>
        </section>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
  <% foot = capture do %><%= tail %><%= yield "publish" %><% end %>
  <% if foot.present? %>
    <div class="project-panels" data-controller="masonry"><%= foot %></div>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
